42| *   engine recently had runnable work. The push arms strictly on the
43| *   active→idle transition (once per run), never on consecutive idle ticks,
44| *   and fires only if the queue is still empty after QUEUE_EMPTY_DEBOUNCE_MS
45| *   (stage-handover safety). Any resumption of work cancels the pending push.
46| * @param {Object} [opts]
